    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> You must be utilizing Frost Dragon Style</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Focus</p><p>You prepare for your enemy's strike, and riposte when they miss.</p><p>When an enemy makes an attack against you, you may spend <strong>-1 Focus</strong> before the attack is rolled to impose <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on the attack. If the attacker has a <strong>Condition</strong> you impose <strong>Greater Disadvantage</strong> instead.</p><p>If the attack misses, you may make a single <strong>Attack Check</strong> against that enemy, provided that they are within range of your equipped weapon.</p>",
